"BlackHole 2ch 与 16ch 是不同设备，两端必须使用同名版本；本机微信曾出现 BlackHole 有电平但对端无声，可选择 CallBridge Microphone 路线对照。" = "BlackHole 2ch and 16ch are separate devices; use the same version at both ends. WeChat has previously shown levels without remote audio on this Mac; compare with CallBridge Microphone if needed.";
"1. 当前目标：%@。%@选择菜单不会安装驱动或修改系统默认设备。\n\n2. 若微信没有麦克风菜单，可手动在“系统设置 → 声音 → 输入”选择 %@。这会影响使用默认输入的其他应用；先记住原设备，测试后自行恢复。输出仍选耳机或扬声器，不要选虚拟设备。\n\n3. 设置输入后重新发起通话，再用 ./CB route-check 只读核对微信实际设备。默认输入、电平跳动、本地发送完成，都不代表对端收到。\n\n4. 勾选允许发送，输入短句并点击发送，让对方复述。\n\n本说明不修改设置、不发声。试听只在本机播放；背景导入后点击“播放背景”并确认，即可独立持续发送。" = "1. Current target: %@. %@Selecting a target does not install drivers or change system defaults.\n\n2. If WeChat has no microphone selector, you can manually choose %@ in System Settings → Sound → Input. This affects other apps using the default input; note the original device and restore it after testing. Keep headphones or speakers as output, not a virtual device.\n\n3. Start a new call after changing input. Use ./CB route-check to inspect WeChat's active device without changing it. Default input, moving meters, or local completion do not prove remote receipt.\n\n4. Allow sending, type a short sentence, and send it. Ask the other person to repeat it.\n\nThis guide changes no settings and plays no sound. Preview plays locally; imported background audio starts only after Play background and confirmation.";
